# Coding Agent Guide for {{cookiecutter.project_name}}

This is a LangGraph project scaffolded by graph-agents-cli. `{{cookiecutter.agent_directory}}/agent.py`
exports `graph`, a compiled LangGraph agent with no checkpointer bound;
`{{cookiecutter.agent_directory}}/fast_api_app.py` exports `app`, the FastAPI application that serves
`POST /chat` (SSE), `GET /threads`, `GET /threads/{id}/messages`, `DELETE /threads/{id}`,
`GET /health` (liveness), `GET /ready` (readiness), `GET /metrics`, `GET /playground`
(dev only) and the A2A protocol under `/a2a/{{cookiecutter.agent_directory}}`.
Runtime: `{{cookiecutter.runtime}}`. Model provider: `{{cookiecutter.model_provider}}` (`MODEL_PROVIDER` in `.env`).
Auth policy: `{{cookiecutter.auth_policy}}` (`AUTH_POLICY`). Every setting and its default is in
`.env.example`; `README.md` explains the API, the auth policies and the deploy rules.

## Governing process

The `process:` line at the top of this file names the process document that
